    "components" : [ {
      "componentAttributes" : {
        "richTextValue" : "<!-- Forms and Resources: the Board's paper forms and reference documents.\n     Links point to the Board's website until the PDFs are hosted on the portal. -->\n<section class=\"lsbc-section\">\n  <p>Most applications can be completed online on this portal. The Board's paper forms and reference documents are below.</p>\n\n  <div class=\"lsbc-doclist\">\n    <div class=\"lsbc-doclist__item\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.lsbc.louisiana.gov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cosmetology Laws and Rules</a>\n      <span>The Board's statute and rules book.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"lsbc-doclist__item\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.lsbc.louisiana.gov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">License Renewal Form</a>\n      <span>Renew a license or permit, or request a duplicate. You can also do this online.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"lsbc-doclist__item\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.lsbc.louisiana.gov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Reciprocity Applications</a>\n      <span>Cosmetology, esthetician, manicurist and instructor packets, with the state-by-state requirements.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"lsbc-doclist__item\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.lsbc.louisiana.gov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Reciprocity - Military</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"lsbc-doclist__item\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.lsbc.louisiana.gov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Foreign Reciprocity Application</a>\n      <span>With the approved credential evaluation agencies.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"lsbc-doclist__item\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.lsbc.louisiana.gov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Temporary Permit Application</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"lsbc-doclist__item\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.lsbc.louisiana.gov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Threading Application</a>\n      <span>With the Facial Threading Study Guide.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"lsbc-doclist__item\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.lsbc.louisiana.gov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Request for Certification of Louisiana Licensure (Affidavit)</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"lsbc-doclist__item\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.lsbc.louisiana.gov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Shop Application</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"lsbc-doclist__item\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.lsbc.louisiana.gov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Threading and Alternative Hair Design Facility Application</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"lsbc-doclist__item\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.lsbc.louisiana.gov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Requirements for Opening a New School</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"lsbc-doclist__item\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.lsbc.louisiana.gov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">School Forms</a>\n      <span>Enrollment, hours, termination, exam and accommodation forms for schools.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"lsbc-doclist__item\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.lsbc.louisiana.gov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Florida Transfer Requirements</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"lsbc-doclist__item\">\n      <a href=\"https://www.lsbc.louisiana.gov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booth Renters Information</a>\n      <span>Guidance on independent contractor status.</span>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <p>Approved continuing education providers are listed on the <a href=\"/LPI/s/ce-providers\">CE Providers</a> page.</p>\n</section>"
      },
